{"4999620":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Banners of Bramble","steam_appid":4999620,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the bridge. Guard your village. Reinforce before the enemy strikes.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banners of Bramble<\/strong> is a single-player, turn-based fantasy tactics game where small armies fight over castles, villages, and monster filled wilds. Command your soldiers, capture buildings, and spend your gold on troops and upgrades before the enemy takes its turn.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give every soldier a job<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold a crossing with warriors, cover an approach with archer overwatch, charge with lancers, and protect wounded allies with monks. Every ability has a purpose and some demand a sacrifice. Raise a warrior’s shield for protection, and they lose the ability to counterattack.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win the ground. Decide how to defend it.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings help fund and strengthen your army, but taking territory means clearing its defenders. Leave a soldier beside a building to protect it from capture, or send them forward to support your attack.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the reinforcement phase, choose where your gold goes: recruit another soldier, improve a building, or save for something your army needs next.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead a campaign with changing objectives<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the kingdom map to contested bridges, defended keeps, and dangerous wilderness. Escort an envoy, rescue prisoners, hold beacons, survive enemy waves, and hunt down monster lairs. Complete bonus objectives for extra rewards and additional challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn campaign perks that improve your soldiers, abilities, buildings, and economy. Shape the army you take into the next battle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expect trouble beyond the castle walls<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rival armies are only part of the challenge. Face spiders, goblins, shamans, bomb-lobbing fish, and a regenerating Troll King. Learn their tricks and adapt your plans across colorful pixel-art battlefields.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the bridge. Guard your village. Reinforce before the enemy strikes.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banners of Bramble<\/strong> is a single-player, turn-based fantasy tactics game where small armies fight over castles, villages, and monster filled wilds. Command your soldiers, capture buildings, and spend your gold on troops and upgrades before the enemy takes its turn.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give every soldier a job<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold a crossing with warriors, cover an approach with archer overwatch, charge with lancers, and protect wounded allies with monks. Every ability has a purpose and some demand a sacrifice. Raise a warrior’s shield for protection, and they lose the ability to counterattack.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win the ground. Decide how to defend it.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings help fund and strengthen your army, but taking territory means clearing its defenders. Leave a soldier beside a building to protect it from capture, or send them forward to support your attack.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the reinforcement phase, choose where your gold goes: recruit another soldier, improve a building, or save for something your army needs next.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead a campaign with changing objectives<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the kingdom map to contested bridges, defended keeps, and dangerous wilderness. Escort an envoy, rescue prisoners, hold beacons, survive enemy waves, and hunt down monster lairs. Complete bonus objectives for extra rewards and additional challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn campaign perks that improve your soldiers, abilities, buildings, and economy. Shape the army you take into the next battle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expect trouble beyond the castle walls<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rival armies are only part of the challenge. Face spiders, goblins, shamans, bomb-lobbing fish, and a regenerating Troll King. Learn their tricks and adapt your plans across colorful pixel-art battlefields.<\/p>","short_description":"Banners of Bramble is a turn-based fantasy tactics game. Lead warriors, archers, lancers and monks, capture castles and villages, and spend your gold wisely. Fight rival kings and the monsters of the Wilds, where shamans turn knights into pigs and fish throw bombs.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4999620\/32d7480e416f5fb9ba253836a2fd2855a358a500\/header.jpg?t=1793748123","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4999620\/5fe70990a36cef76e01f15d94f65aeb80f52eea8\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793748123","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4999620\/5fe70990a36cef76e01f15d94f65aeb80f52eea8\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793748123","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 64-bit CPU with SSE4.2 (Intel Core i3-4xxx \/ AMD FX-6300 or<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 12 or Vulkan 1.0 GPU: Intel HD Graphics 520 \/ NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 \/ AMD Radeon HD 7750<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1280×720 display or higher<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1920×1080 display<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Parabolic","Lucky"],"publishers":["Parabolic","Lucky"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":499,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$4.99"},"packages":[1859061],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Banners of Bramble","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1859061,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Banners of Bramble - $4.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":499}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":64,"description":"Adjustable Text Size"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":66,"description":"Color Alternatives"},{"id":82,"description":"#category_contrast_controls"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":17,"description":"Includes level editor"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_asse